  "question": "Do authoritative public serial-history witnesses explicitly establish that the 1950-1958 historical periodical 《文物参考资料/文物参攷資料》 was renamed to the successor title 《文物》 from January 1959?",
  "answer": "Yes. CiNii NCID AA11467834 records 《文物参攷資料》 for 1950.1-1958.12, including 1951 volume 2 issues 1-12, and marks an after-rename/continues-by relation. CiNii NCID AN00060837 records 《文物》 from 1959.1, starting with 总101号, marks a before-rename/continues relation, carries ISSN 05114772, and shares Bibliographic History ID 41870900 with the predecessor record. Independently, the official 文物出版社 development-history page states that in January 1959 《文物参考资料》月刊 was renamed 《文物》月刊. Therefore the carrier-title crosswalk is closed as a serial rename. For a 1951 citation the historical carrier title remains 《文物参考资料》; current federated-database label 文物 may be annotated as a successor/current normalized title for the same serial chain, not treated as a distinct 1951 journal.",
